Wine Mono (an implementation of the .NET Framework for wine, based on
Mono) and Wine Gecko (wine's HTML engine, used by mshtml) in the versions
Valve's Proton 11.0-2e bundles, installed where emulators/proton-wine
looks for them. With them, programs that need .NET or embed web views can
run, and new prefixes no longer offer to download the add-ons.

These are the upstream projects' prebuilt Windows binaries.
